  {
    "id": "1244303",
    "original": "最近僕の義弟Ｙ砲兵少佐が、三年間の巴里駐在を終へて帰つて来た。数々の土産物を取巻いて、われわれはいろいろな土産話を聴いた。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "1248691",
        "text": "Recently my brother in law, artillery major Y, came back from a three year trip in Paris. Surrounded by a great number of souvenirs he had brought back, we heard tales of his travels."
      }
    ],
